	(text "3V3 regulator to power the PICs so we can run 3v3 IO everywhere\nLevel shifters/5V/12V tolerant inputs and outputs on the PIC UART ports\nDo we need indicator LEDs\nDoes SPI need pullups or series resistors\nDoes one big reset work?\n"
